data: {"id": "3906b11c74ab4fb3-thinking-parallel_evidence-391", "run_id": "3906b11c74ab4fb3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我收到了代码预采集的基线结果。现在我将继续执行既有 evidence_plan 中剩余的工具调用，并基于已有结果进行分析。\n\n**已完成的预采集基线回顾：**\n\n| 工具 | 维度 | 结果 |\n|------|------|------|\n| execute_pod_promql | Metrics | ✅ 存在: `waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff`, `last_terminated_reason=OOMKilled`, `restarts_total=12`, `phase=Running` |\n| query_pod_logs | Logging | ✅ 存在: 最近日志显示\"memory allocation advanced\"，allocated_mib 从 36 增长到 48，HTTP 200 |\n| query_pod_tracing | Tracing | ✅ 存在: 20 条 Flow + 5 条 Tempo Span，全部是 `GET /work` 返回 200，且带有 `aiops.observed_mode=oom_gro", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788452434180, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

