data: {"id": "3906b11c74ab4fb3-thinking-parallel_evidence-599", "run_id": "3906b11c74ab4fb3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已收到上游预采集的结果。现在继续执行证据计划中的剩余工具调用，以确认 CrashLoopBackOff 的直接原因。\n\n**已完成的预采集基线回顾：**\n- **Metrics**: 存在 `waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff`, `last_terminated_reason=OOMKilled`, `restarts_total=12`, `phase=Running`\n- **Logging**: 最近日志显示\"memory allocation failed\"\n- **Tracing**: 崩溃前短暂请求延迟激增\n\n**需要补充的证据：**\n- `kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl get yaml` 确认具体状态和资源配置\n- `kubectl previous logs` 和 `kubectl logs` 查看崩溃前后的详细日志\n- `kubectl events` 确认 Kubelet 的 Killing/OOM 事件\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788452462750, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

