data: {"id": "3906b11c74ab4fb3-thinking-parallel_evidence-601", "run_id": "3906b11c74ab4fb3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=574 lines=13\nTodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=539 lines=12\nInvestigation plan updated with 8 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 3 completed, 1 in progress, 4 pend", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788452462770, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_299128b216144f69bce9dad4", "tool_sequence": 5, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=574 lines=13\nTodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=539 lines=12\nInvestigation plan updated with 8 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 3 completed, 1 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [4] kubectl get pod yaml - 检查 command/args/resources/limits\n[ ] [5] kubectl previous logs - 查找崩溃前错误日志\n[ ] [6] kubectl events - 确认 Kubelet 的 Killing/OOM 事件\n[ ] [7] 证据汇总分析：CrashLoopBackOff 的直接原因判定\n[~] [3] kubectl describe pod - 确认当前状态、Exit Code、Reason\n[✓] [0] 预采集 Metrics 基线（已执行）\n[✓] [1] 预采集 Logging 基线（已执行）\n[✓] [2] 预采集 Tracing 基线（已执行）\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3906b11c74ab4fb3-g1/tools/008-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3906b11c74ab4fb3-g1/tools/008-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3906b11c74ab4fb3-g1/tools/008-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

